Cell["Interactome", "TechNoteSection",ExpressionUUID->"8eddf512-2753-1c4a-be9e-5e907d1281d8"],

Cell["\<\
Atlas scores TP53 against every protein in the human proteome and keeps its \
strongest partners. Vertices are gene symbols, each edge carries the Atlas \
confidence, and the enrichment of the neighborhood rides along as an \
annotation.\
\>", "TechNoteText",ExpressionUUID->"6d48bf60-310b-2242-889d-fb1141e2ee83"],

