Cell["Strongest partners", "TechNoteSection",ExpressionUUID->"38086bbf-52b8-7946-8bc2-69cb96e57a04"],

Cell["\<\
The interactome keeps the 50 strongest partners, so MDM2, the ubiquitin \
ligase that holds p53 in check, falls just outside it. Scoring pairs directly \
shows where it stands.\
\>", "TechNoteText",ExpressionUUID->"7599e3e8-88d2-bc45-9ff9-69645a146979"],

