Cell["Small molecules", "TechNoteSection",ExpressionUUID->"dc70f611-a6df-0d41-b8a7-c4acaaedf4be"],

Cell["\<\
Nutlin-3a and idasanutlin occupy the pocket on MDM2 where p53 binds; \
eprenetapopt (APR-246) reactivates mutant p53 by modifying its cysteines; \
aspirin is a control. A ligand is SMILES, a chemical name, a Molecule, or \
Entity[\"Chemical\", ...].\
\>", "TechNoteText",ExpressionUUID->"81d83aec-6a5b-7e44-8cd7-bf343446d753"],

