Cell["The MDM2 and p53 complex", "TechNoteSection",ExpressionUUID->"c23701b3-dd74-d746-995c-61763ca99f5c"],

Cell["\<\
MDM2's N-terminal domain, residues 17 to 125, grips the amphipathic helix of \
p53's transactivation domain, residues 15 to 29 (crystal structure 1YCR). \
ESMFold2 folds the two chains together; ipTM measures its confidence in the \
interface.\
\>", "TechNoteText",ExpressionUUID->"160bf20e-27ec-1c47-825d-381931ac848a"],

